  "answer": "Project Zenith is a cloud storage optimization initiative led by Marcus Cole, launching in Q3 2023 with a $2M budget approved by the executive board. The project has secured a strategic partnership with TechInnovate and expanded its team with five new members specializing in cybersecurity and cloud architecture. Initial findings suggest a potential 20% efficiency increase through AI algorithms, and the prototype for secure file sharing has successfully completed testing ahead of schedule. The project is currently in a phase of gathering innovative ideas for data visualization tools, seeking stakeholder feedback on the prototype, and planning user interface enhancements for October, with a milestone celebration scheduled for October 10th."
